1
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:34,940
[In my prime]

2
00:01:35,270 --> 00:01:37,820
[Episode 12]

3
00:01:45,110 --> 00:01:48,150
[Two months later]

4
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:11,900
Time to get off the bus.

5
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:06,430
Qi Zhi!

6
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:08,520
Si!

7
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:23,840
Is Qi Zhi still our son?

8
00:03:25,470 --> 00:03:26,240
He wouldn't listen

9
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:27,790
to a word I say.

10
00:03:28,690 --> 00:03:29,280
My goodness.

11
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,000
I can't believe he went

12
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:32,060
t-to meet Cao Si behind my back again.

13
00:03:32,470 --> 00:03:33,870
He said they just ran into

14
00:03:33,910 --> 00:03:35,170
each other, didn't he?

15
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:36,030
"Ran into each other"?

16
00:03:36,030 --> 00:03:38,160
Only you would believe that lie of his.

17
00:03:38,470 --> 00:03:39,750
For what reason would they

18
00:03:39,750 --> 00:03:41,550
come back at the exact same time?

19
00:03:41,710 --> 00:03:43,910
Too coincidental to be true, wasn't it?

20
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:54,520
Our son truly cares

21
00:03:55,030 --> 00:03:56,560
a lot about Cao Si.

22
00:03:58,800 --> 00:03:59,730
What do you mean?

23
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:04,260
The grudges between our families aside,

24
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,710
we did watch

25
00:04:06,710 --> 00:04:07,560
Cao Si

26
00:04:07,580 --> 00:04:08,550
grow up.

27
00:04:10,150 --> 00:04:11,710
We know her well.

28
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:13,430
What now?

29
00:04:13,430 --> 00:04:15,690
You want to be in-laws
with Cao Dongfang?

30
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,040
Who?

31
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:17,600
You.

32
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:19,360
Who said that?

33
00:04:19,829 --> 00:04:21,430
I've never had that thought.

34
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:23,720
Regardless of what kind
of person Cao Dongfang is,

35
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:25,120
Cao Si is quite

36
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,870
a decent young woman

37
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,420
with great character.

38
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,240
Haven't you

39
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,480
always liked her too?

40
00:04:32,070 --> 00:04:33,870
That's another matter, really.

41
00:04:34,510 --> 00:04:36,430
Whether our son can make the national team

42
00:04:36,430 --> 00:04:39,090
depends on his efforts
in this year and the next.

43
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:41,080
Whether it's Cao Si or anyone else,

44
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:44,310
if they hold my son back
from the provincial or national team,

45
00:04:44,310 --> 00:04:46,370
I will... I will fight them till I die!

46
00:04:48,159 --> 00:04:49,490
Under no circumstances

47
00:04:50,330 --> 00:04:51,210
will I agree to

48
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,370
let them be a couple!

49
00:04:58,310 --> 00:04:59,240
Mom fights

50
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,130
as fiercely as ever.

51
00:05:02,950 --> 00:05:03,630
You're smart.

52
00:05:03,630 --> 00:05:05,290
Come up with a solution for me.

53
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,510
Do you remember

54
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:12,410
how we made Grandma go back home

55
00:05:12,870 --> 00:05:14,310
that time she visited?

56
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:16,730
When Grandma was here, she took you

57
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:19,270
to collect cardboard every day,

58
00:05:19,270 --> 00:05:20,740
causing your grades to drop.

59
00:05:20,740 --> 00:05:21,920
Then your teacher came over

60
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:22,920
and talked to her.

61
00:05:23,210 --> 00:05:24,270
Grandma felt sorry

62
00:05:24,270 --> 00:05:25,750
for distracting you from your studies.

63
00:05:25,750 --> 00:05:26,280
Exactly.

64
00:05:27,870 --> 00:05:28,720
Then let's say

65
00:05:30,430 --> 00:05:31,310
keeping you

66
00:05:31,510 --> 00:05:33,240
from dating Cao Si compromises

67
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:35,880
your performance at the sports school.

68
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:37,970
How do you think Mom will react?

69
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,830
Right.

70
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:44,510
We can use that tactic again

71
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:46,930
and make Mom give in.

72
00:05:49,310 --> 00:05:50,000
Let's go.

73
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:52,010
I didn't finish the game!

74
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:53,500
An important matter awaits us.

75
00:05:53,500 --> 00:05:54,040
Hurry!

76
00:05:54,070 --> 00:05:55,040
What do you two want with me?

77
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:56,070
I was in a crucial round!

78
00:05:56,070 --> 00:05:56,800
Just go! Go!

79
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:57,750
Ouch, it hurts!

80
00:05:58,390 --> 00:05:59,310
Let go of me.

81
00:05:59,510 --> 00:06:01,170
Qi Zhi's performance has been

82
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,680
utterly unsatisfactory

83
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:04,310
during these two months of training.

84
00:06:04,310 --> 00:06:06,600
The coaching team is very disappointed

85
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,750
with his performance.

86
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:09,920
What are you laughing at?

87
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:11,320
What's funny about this?

88
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:12,750
This won't do.

89
00:06:12,750 --> 00:06:14,390
You'll definitely give a tell.

90
00:06:14,390 --> 00:06:16,320
I told you he couldn't handle this.

91
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:17,630
He was terrible at acting as a cat

92
00:06:17,630 --> 00:06:18,630
in the stage play last time.

93
00:06:18,630 --> 00:06:19,830
He even had the nerve
to go on stage.

94
00:06:19,830 --> 00:06:21,190
I was completely immersed in

95
00:06:21,190 --> 00:06:22,040
the role.

96
00:06:22,290 --> 00:06:23,800
Wait, you two asked me for help,

97
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,530
and now you're criticizing me?

98
00:06:25,830 --> 00:06:27,630
Speaking of being pretentious,

99
00:06:27,630 --> 00:06:29,030
I've thought of someone.

100
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,510
Hello, Mrs. Qi.

101
00:06:32,830 --> 00:06:34,490
I'm Qi Zhi's assistant coach.

102
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,190
Qi Zhi's performance has been

103
00:06:36,190 --> 00:06:37,040
utterly unsatisfactory

104
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,530
during these two months of training.

105
00:06:38,530 --> 00:06:39,790
Alright, you're on it.

106
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:44,950
It takes a fortune to have me

107
00:06:44,950 --> 00:06:46,080
make an appearance.

108
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,050
Two sets of hangers.

109
00:06:49,310 --> 00:06:50,040
Hangers.

110
00:06:53,070 --> 00:06:53,750
Soap.

111
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,070
Hello?

112
00:06:57,390 --> 00:06:57,870
Hello.

113
00:06:58,190 --> 00:07:00,050
This is Qi Zhi's assistant coach.

114
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:02,070
Qi Zhi's assistant coach?

115
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:03,510
Hello, hello.

116
00:07:03,940 --> 00:07:05,360
The coaching team is very disappointed

117
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,380
with Zhi's performance.

118
00:07:06,380 --> 00:07:07,300
At this rate,

119
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,750
let alone the national team,

120
00:07:08,750 --> 00:07:09,560
I'm afraid he won't even make it

121
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,960
to the provincial games.

122
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,150
Wait, Coach.

123
00:07:13,310 --> 00:07:14,710
Coach, please calm down.

124
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,300
P-Please don't be mad.

125
00:07:16,750 --> 00:07:17,240
Zhi is probably

126
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:18,600
a bit emotionally unstable

127
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:20,170
since he is going through puberty.

128
00:07:20,170 --> 00:07:21,160
When your child is upset,

129
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,190
as his parents,

130
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:24,360
you shouldn't go firmly against him.

131
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,360
At the very least,

132
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:26,630
before he could make the provincial team,

133
00:07:26,630 --> 00:07:27,360
your priority

134
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:29,220
should be soothing his emotions.

135
00:07:30,950 --> 00:07:32,000
Well, then, Coach,

136
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:34,190
how do we do that?

137
00:07:36,820 --> 00:07:37,820
How do you do that?

138
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,650
You need me to teach you how?

139
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:43,360
Just buy him

140
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:44,510
whatever he wants to eat.

141
00:07:44,510 --> 00:07:45,480
Let him do

142
00:07:45,510 --> 00:07:46,570
what he wants to do.

143
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:48,560
The biggest taboo for parents

144
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:50,020
is overreaching and being too controlling.

145
00:07:50,020 --> 00:07:51,080
When you do that...

146
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:55,140
Anyway,

147
00:07:55,390 --> 00:07:56,950
I hope he will be in better shape

148
00:07:56,950 --> 00:07:58,080
and show some spirit

149
00:07:58,310 --> 00:07:59,920
as he attends the next training camp.

150
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:01,510
Okay. Coach, I...

151
00:08:06,310 --> 00:08:06,840
Alright.

152
00:08:07,390 --> 00:08:08,320
The show is over.

153
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,520
Now you can have a month's worth

154
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:11,340
of mock exams

155
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,180
What did the coach say?

156
00:08:23,490 --> 00:08:24,120
He told us not

157
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,430
to be too controlling,

158
00:08:26,310 --> 00:08:28,640
and that we should soothe Zhi's emotions.

159
00:08:28,870 --> 00:08:30,070
We should let him eat and do

160
00:08:30,070 --> 00:08:31,190
whatever he wants.

161
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:37,320
The provincial games are approaching.

162
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:38,669
It's no good for our son

163
00:08:38,669 --> 00:08:39,870
to keep being so down.

164
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:42,340
It would definitely irritate the coach.

165
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:44,360
What should we do then?

166
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,390
I've tried talking

167
00:08:45,390 --> 00:08:46,320
some sense into Zhi,

168
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,920
but he just wouldn't listen.

169
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,270
The coach was right.

170
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,320
At the current stage,

171
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:54,150
we surely have to

172
00:08:54,150 --> 00:08:55,750
prioritize Qi Zhi's future.

173
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,170
How about...

174
00:09:00,670 --> 00:09:02,080
we tell our son this:

175
00:09:03,030 --> 00:09:04,390
as long as he makes it

176
00:09:04,390 --> 00:09:05,720
to the provincial team,

177
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:08,110
we may allow him and Cao Si to get

178
00:09:08,110 --> 00:09:08,750
together.

179
00:09:10,750 --> 00:09:11,360
No way!

180
00:09:14,210 --> 00:09:16,010
Your spit flew right into my eye.

181
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:29,670
Son,

182
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:34,160
as long as you get admitted
to the provincial team,

183
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,330
we may make a concession

184
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:41,850
on you dating Cao Si.

185
00:09:43,460 --> 00:09:44,860
Is that an approval, Mom?

186
00:09:46,270 --> 00:09:47,390
If you make the provincial team,

187
00:09:47,390 --> 00:09:49,190
everything will be negotiable.

188
00:09:49,270 --> 00:09:50,360
Son, rest assured.

189
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:52,260
Your mom always

190
00:09:52,290 --> 00:09:53,290
keeps her word.

191
00:09:54,150 --> 00:09:55,750
We are all witnesses to that.

192
00:09:57,910 --> 00:09:59,310
But I have one condition.

193
00:09:59,510 --> 00:10:00,170
Say it, Mom.

194
00:10:00,790 --> 00:10:01,960
Before you make the team,

195
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,420
you must focus on training

196
00:10:03,630 --> 00:10:05,360
and refrain from seeing Cao Si.

197
00:10:06,870 --> 00:10:08,220
Mom, I promise

198
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,510
I will focus on training.

199
00:10:09,510 --> 00:10:10,040
I'll make

200
00:10:10,100 --> 00:10:10,760
you, Cao Si,

201
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:11,970
and the coach proud.

202
00:10:12,510 --> 00:10:13,720
I'll make Dad and my sister

203
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:14,320
proud too.

204
00:10:15,470 --> 00:10:16,230
The coach said

205
00:10:16,230 --> 00:10:17,000
though we're on break,

206
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:18,660
strength training must go on.

207
00:10:20,430 --> 00:10:21,960
I'm going out for extra training!

208
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:22,360
You...

209
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:25,870
Careful.

210
00:10:26,390 --> 00:10:27,990
He didn't even finish lunch.

211
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:31,960
My mom said

212
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:34,200
she'd allow Zhi to date Cao Si

213
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:36,120
once he made it to the provincial team.

214
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:37,630
But before that, the two of them

215
00:10:37,630 --> 00:10:38,560
must not meet up.

216
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,150
How come it gives me a feeling

217
00:10:43,150 --> 00:10:44,880
that Mrs. Huo is just stalling?

218
00:10:44,910 --> 00:10:46,140
It doesn't matter.

219
00:10:46,550 --> 00:10:47,280
What matters

220
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:48,920
is that my mom's words

221
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:49,550
basically

222
00:10:49,550 --> 00:10:50,930
gave Zhi a free pass.

223
00:10:51,510 --> 00:10:52,910
My dad and I both heard it.

224
00:10:53,030 --> 00:10:54,320
We are witnesses to her words.

225
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,850
My mom can't go back on that.

226
00:10:58,240 --> 00:10:59,080
Zhi also said

227
00:10:59,670 --> 00:11:01,360
that he'd like to see Cao Si one more time

228
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:03,020
before leaving for training.

229
00:11:03,090 --> 00:11:03,760
He asked us

230
00:11:03,790 --> 00:11:04,790
to cover for him.

231
00:11:05,270 --> 00:11:05,600
Okay.

232
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:30,600
These are for you.

233
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:38,510
Si,

234
00:11:39,790 --> 00:11:40,440
I'm sorry

235
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:43,290
to upset you these past two months.

236
00:11:43,750 --> 00:11:44,390
My coach

237
00:11:44,390 --> 00:11:46,120
removed the phone from my dorm.

238
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:47,120
So, I...

239
00:11:47,910 --> 00:11:48,750
I know.

240
00:11:50,290 --> 00:11:51,250
Qi Shi already

241
00:11:51,390 --> 00:11:53,250
had Cao Xin pass the message to me.

242
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:55,050
Well then...

243
00:11:57,270 --> 00:11:58,070
will you still

244
00:11:58,080 --> 00:11:59,000
stick with me?

245
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:02,910
My family won't let me.

246
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:05,670
Si,

247
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:09,390
I don't care if my mom and others agree
to let us be together.

248
00:12:09,390 --> 00:12:11,120
As long as our hearts are as one,

249
00:12:11,670 --> 00:12:13,200
nothing can stop us.

250
00:12:14,540 --> 00:12:15,540
Someone once said

251
00:12:15,550 --> 00:12:17,480
that love is like a long-distance race.

252
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:20,340
To sprint for the gold medal and win,
it's certainly

253
00:12:20,510 --> 00:12:22,790
important to have
all the favorable factors,

254
00:12:22,790 --> 00:12:23,990
but what matters more

255
00:12:24,750 --> 00:12:25,720
is persistence.

256
00:12:27,390 --> 00:12:28,670
It's persistence.

257
00:12:31,150 --> 00:12:32,080
Persistence...

258
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,150
As an athlete,

259
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:37,960
I know the meaning of persistence

260
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:39,360
better than anyone does.

261
00:12:39,630 --> 00:12:39,960
I...

262
00:12:40,670 --> 00:12:41,400
What is this?

263
00:12:41,510 --> 00:12:42,120
Si.

264
00:12:42,910 --> 00:12:43,960
How dare you.

265
00:12:44,150 --> 00:12:45,320
You even made a cheat sheet for this.

266
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:46,580
No, it's not like that.

267
00:12:47,030 --> 00:12:47,490
Indeed,

268
00:12:47,510 --> 00:12:49,360
I asked Qi Shi to write this for me.

269
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:50,560
But I was lying to you.

270
00:12:50,630 --> 00:12:52,360
This is exactly what I meant to say.

271
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:53,840
You done covering for Zhi?

272
00:12:55,390 --> 00:12:57,250
Your mom is a real pain in the neck.

273
00:12:57,950 --> 00:12:59,150
She's buying beans for me

274
00:12:59,150 --> 00:13:00,320
at the market right now.

275
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:02,120
The peeling will take her a while.

276
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:02,480
Okay.

277
00:13:03,790 --> 00:13:04,320
Look.

278
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:07,200
Love in real life is no less

279
00:13:07,870 --> 00:13:09,390
dramatic than in TV dramas.

280
00:13:09,390 --> 00:13:10,210
All you know

281
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,080
is TV dramas.

282
00:13:11,750 --> 00:13:13,280
I'm not like that, alright?

283
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:15,510
But I do think

284
00:13:15,510 --> 00:13:16,630
you said it right.

285
00:13:17,150 --> 00:13:18,770
One must be persistent,

286
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:20,330
try to do they want to do,

287
00:13:20,670 --> 00:13:22,630
and bravely love
whoever they want to love.

288
00:13:22,630 --> 00:13:23,440
Then all obstacles

289
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:25,040
will become insignificant.

290
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:25,600
Si,

291
00:13:26,670 --> 00:13:28,150
my mom has made her stance clear.

292
00:13:28,150 --> 00:13:29,750
As long as I win the championship
at the provincial games

293
00:13:29,750 --> 00:13:30,840
and make the provincial team,

294
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:31,670
