403
00:18:43,510 --> 00:18:44,640
As long as I win the championship
at the provincial games

404
00:18:43,580 --> 00:18:45,180
♪ Why does this world ♪

405
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:45,720
and make the provincial team,

406
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:48,320
♪ Have to slander ♪

407
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:46,790
I'll have

408
00:18:46,790 --> 00:18:47,880
a final showdown with them,

409
00:18:47,880 --> 00:18:48,940
