us being together or not.

410
00:18:48,940 --> 00:18:52,570
♪ What I believe again ♪

411
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:49,480
I,

412
00:18:49,830 --> 00:18:50,230
Qi Zhi,

413
00:18:50,550 --> 00:18:52,080
