573
00:26:18,720 --> 00:26:19,310
Yes.

574
00:26:21,640 --> 00:26:22,840
Counting money, Dad?

575
00:26:23,550 --> 00:26:24,720
Good sales today, huh?

576
00:26:24,720 --> 00:26:25,980
