647
00:28:35,480 --> 00:28:36,510
into this.

648
00:28:36,890 --> 00:28:38,000
Do you think these photos

649
00:28:38,000 --> 00:28:39,110
will really sell?

650
00:28:41,350 --> 00:28:42,510
The people on them

651
00:28:42,960 --> 00:28:44,270
don't seem as handsome as me

652
00:28:44,270 --> 00:28:44,930
in my youth.

653
00:28:46,480 --> 00:28:46,830
Dad,

654
00:28:47,400 --> 00:28:48,930
