655
00:28:49,600 --> 00:28:51,480
They are all super stars

656
00:28:51,640 --> 00:28:52,640
and very popular.

657
00:28:52,880 --> 00:28:53,440
Really?

658
00:28:53,780 --> 00:28:56,980
Their photos will surely sell
better
than medicated oil.

659
00:28:57,200 --> 00:28:58,530
We'll split the profits

660
00:28:58,960 --> 00:28:59,690
as we agreed.

661
00:28:59,830 --> 00:29:01,760
You'll definitely get your share.

662
00:29:01,960 --> 00:29:02,690
Absolutely.

663
00:29:03,240 --> 00:29:05,500
We're business partners now, after all.

664
00:29:06,830 --> 00:29:08,290
But business is business.

665
00:29:08,590 --> 00:29:10,110
Don't neglect your studies.

666
00:29:10,110 --> 00:29:11,910
Once you save enough for the fee,

667
00:29:12,030 --> 00:29:13,110
