668
00:29:13,830 --> 00:29:14,560
Don't worry,

669
00:29:15,400 --> 00:29:16,600
I know what I'm doing.

670
00:29:19,720 --> 00:29:20,350
I'm leaving then.

671
00:29:20,350 --> 00:29:21,000
Off you go.

672
00:29:35,790 --> 00:29:36,200
Si.

673
00:29:38,830 --> 00:29:39,520
I swear,

674
00:29:40,110 --> 00:29:41,570
I'm truly in love with you.

675
00:29:41,830 --> 00:29:42,560
Zhou Xuanyu,

676
00:29:42,720 --> 00:29:43,310
I've told you

677
00:29:43,310 --> 00:29:44,570
I have a boyfriend now.

678
00:29:45,200 --> 00:29:46,030
I know.

679
