But you two aren't married.

680
00:29:47,830 --> 00:29:49,890
It's not illegal for me to pursue you.

681
00:29:49,960 --> 00:29:51,290
Do you think this is fun?

682
00:29:52,790 --> 00:29:53,920
I just can't help it.

683
00:29:54,070 --> 00:29:54,940
My heart aches when a day passes

684
00:29:54,940 --> 00:29:55,840
