692
00:30:04,640 --> 00:30:05,830
You have the right to reject me.

693
00:30:05,830 --> 00:30:07,490
I have the right to pursue you.

694
00:30:07,590 --> 00:30:08,350
Besides,

695
00:30:08,830 --> 00:30:10,630
