702
00:30:22,830 --> 00:30:24,480
You want to embarrass your dad or what?

703
00:30:24,480 --> 00:30:25,680
What does this have to do with you?

704
00:30:25,680 --> 00:30:27,480
What does this have to do with me?

705
00:30:27,550 --> 00:30:29,280
Si is my future sister-in-law.

706
00:30:31,700 --> 00:30:32,640
I was wondering why Qi Zhi

707
00:30:32,640 --> 00:30:34,100
