708
00:30:34,160 --> 00:30:35,690
So he's the man you're with?

709
00:30:35,920 --> 00:30:36,960
How is he better than me?

710
00:30:36,960 --> 00:30:37,760
You chose him?

711
00:30:37,960 --> 00:30:38,760
He's so silly.

712
00:30:38,880 --> 00:30:39,830
Who are you calling silly?

713
00:30:39,830 --> 00:30:42,040
My brother is better than you
in every way.

714
00:30:42,040 --> 00:30:42,720
You are nowhere

715
00:30:42,720 --> 00:30:43,840
near as good as him.

716
00:30:44,240 --> 00:30:45,170
I'm warning you,

717
00:30:45,200 --> 00:30:46,800
