718
00:30:46,830 --> 00:30:48,460
Or I will spare you no mercy.

719
00:30:54,830 --> 00:30:55,960
Why are you staring?

720
00:30:56,440 --> 00:30:57,570
Why are you staring?

721
00:30:59,270 --> 00:31:00,350
Didn't you learn a lesson
when I beat you up

722
00:31:00,350 --> 00:31:01,090
in childhood?

723
00:31:01,090 --> 00:31:02,220
Still staring, huh?

724
00:31:13,350 --> 00:31:13,830
Si,

725
00:31:14,240 --> 00:31:15,570
if he pesters you again,

726
00:31:15,830 --> 00:31:16,680
just let me know.

727
00:31:16,680 --> 00:31:17,810
I'll fix him for you.

728
00:31:18,030 --> 00:31:18,480
I know.

729
00:31:19,640 --> 00:31:21,070
You're truly something, just like

730
00:31:21,070 --> 00:31:22,030
