731
00:31:22,030 --> 00:31:22,880
Of course.

732
00:31:23,440 --> 00:31:24,880
You're my future sister-in-law.

733
00:31:24,880 --> 00:31:25,810
When Zhi is away,

734
00:31:25,830 --> 00:31:27,560
I must protect you in his stead.

735
00:31:31,640 --> 00:31:33,480
What's in your backpack?

736
00:31:33,510 --> 00:31:34,640
It seems heavy.

737
00:31:37,790 --> 00:31:38,160
Look.

738
00:31:38,880 --> 00:31:40,270
I didn't lie to you, did I?

739
00:31:40,270 --> 00:31:41,800
I have everything you want.

740
00:31:42,270 --> 00:31:43,070
Limited editions.

741
00:31:43,070 --> 00:31:44,070
Ten yuan for each.

742
00:31:44,440 --> 00:31:45,440
Ten yuan for each.

743
00:31:46,960 --> 00:31:47,960
These look pretty nice.

744
00:31:47,960 --> 00:31:48,460
Senior,

745
00:31:48,550 --> 00:31:50,150
