746
00:31:52,590 --> 00:31:53,310
Here's the pay.

747
00:31:53,310 --> 00:31:54,640
And I want a photo of Avril Lavigne.

748
00:31:54,640 --> 00:31:55,840
This one is handsome.

749
00:31:56,000 --> 00:31:57,480
Senior, I'll take this one.

750
00:31:57,480 --> 00:31:57,960
So cute.

751
00:31:58,880 --> 00:32:00,140
T-This one is good too.

752
00:32:00,160 --> 00:32:00,640
Look.

753
00:32:00,960 --> 00:32:02,440
He look a bit like Cao Xin, right?

754
00:32:02,440 --> 00:32:02,830
One photo.

755
00:32:02,830 --> 00:32:03,890
Cao Xin? Let me see.

756
00:32:04,270 --> 00:32:05,870
The two of them do look alike.

757
00:32:06,110 --> 00:32:07,560
I've seen Cao Xin play basketball.

758
00:32:07,560 --> 00:32:08,790
I was totally impressed

759
00:32:08,790 --> 00:32:09,920
by his flawless side profile

760
00:32:09,920 --> 00:32:11,030
from every angle.

761
00:32:11,790 --> 00:32:12,520
He's so cute.

762
00:32:14,070 --> 00:32:14,680
Let me see.

763
00:32:15,310 --> 00:32:16,160
-Let me see.
-Me too.

764
00:32:16,160 --> 00:32:16,760
Let me see.

765
00:32:17,990 --> 00:32:19,580
Girls, Cao Xin is not only

766
00:32:19,610 --> 00:32:20,590
good at basketball,

767
00:32:20,590 --> 00:32:21,790
but also at studying.

768
00:32:22,360 --> 00:32:23,200
I heard he made it to the top

769
00:32:23,200 --> 00:32:24,350
