770
00:32:24,350 --> 00:32:26,280
-Really? Impressive.
-He's good.

771
00:32:27,110 --> 00:32:28,310
He's truly handsome.

772
00:32:28,480 --> 00:32:29,720
Handsome and smart.

773
00:32:29,750 --> 00:32:30,960
Cute and tall.

774
00:32:32,430 --> 00:32:33,430
He is pretty good.

775
00:32:33,720 --> 00:32:35,850
I think he's even cuter than Hua Ze Lei.

776
00:32:38,170 --> 00:32:38,920
Do you girls want

777
00:32:38,920 --> 00:32:39,920
photos of Cao Xin?

778
00:32:40,160 --> 00:32:41,220
-Cao Xin?
-Cao Xin?

779
00:32:41,280 --> 00:32:42,410
Unreleased photos.

780
00:32:43,080 --> 00:32:44,650
Wonderful moments

781
00:32:44,680 --> 00:32:46,010
