782
00:32:47,060 --> 00:32:47,880
-I want those!
-So do I!

783
00:32:47,880 --> 00:32:48,620
-Senior.
-Senior.

784
00:32:48,620 --> 00:32:50,420
-I want those.
-I do too.

785
00:32:52,160 --> 00:32:53,070
Qi Shi ranks first

786
00:32:53,070 --> 00:32:54,400
