795
00:33:14,680 --> 00:33:17,340
There's no such thing as free lunch
in the world.

796
00:33:17,680 --> 00:33:19,540
In exchange for my study secrets,

797
00:33:21,310 --> 00:33:22,750
lend me your camera for two days.

798
00:33:22,750 --> 00:33:24,410
What do you need my camera for?

799
00:33:25,000 --> 00:33:26,330
It doesn't concern you.

800
00:33:26,880 --> 00:33:28,000
Just tell me if you'll say yes or no.

801
00:33:28,000 --> 00:33:28,440
No.

802
00:33:32,050 --> 00:33:32,910
Suit yourself.

803
00:33:33,480 --> 00:33:34,920
Forget about the secrets then.

804
00:33:34,920 --> 00:33:35,790
How stingy.

805
00:34:06,310 --> 00:34:07,440
Why was the flash on?

806
00:34:17,320 --> 00:34:18,960
