814
00:34:34,429 --> 00:34:35,719
You're overthinking it.

815
00:34:35,719 --> 00:34:37,320
Who would have a crush on you?

816
00:34:40,670 --> 00:34:41,630
I was just...

817
00:34:43,219 --> 00:34:44,760
Graduation is approaching, isn't it?

818
00:34:44,760 --> 00:34:46,400
I just wanted to take some photos

819
00:34:46,400 --> 00:34:47,199
