820
00:34:47,230 --> 00:34:48,570
You could've just told me so.

821
00:34:48,570 --> 00:34:49,370
Why so sneaky?

822
00:34:49,840 --> 00:34:51,100
I would've allowed it.

823
00:34:51,360 --> 00:34:51,840
Really?

824
00:34:53,679 --> 00:34:54,739
What are you doing?

825
00:34:56,000 --> 00:34:56,719
No, wait...

826
00:34:58,510 --> 00:35:00,070
You have no manners at all.

827
00:35:00,530 --> 00:35:01,510
How is he so handsome?

828
00:35:01,510 --> 00:35:03,040
Yours is not bad, actually.

829
00:35:03,800 --> 00:35:05,330
He looks so cute in this one.

830
00:35:06,030 --> 00:35:08,090
Yeah, he looks so good when he smiles.

831
00:35:09,440 --> 00:35:10,320
So handsome!

832
00:35:10,440 --> 00:35:11,000
Cao!

833
00:35:11,480 --> 00:35:12,360
He's so cute!

834
00:35:12,880 --> 00:35:13,880
Not bad.

835
00:35:14,850 --> 00:35:15,710
Your fan club even

836
00:35:15,710 --> 00:35:17,090
dug up unreleased photos of you.

837
00:35:17,090 --> 00:35:18,170
He's so handsome.

838
00:35:20,710 --> 00:35:22,000
So handsome.

839
00:35:24,590 --> 00:35:25,590
Qi Shi!

840
00:35:28,210 --> 00:35:29,340
What have you done?

841
00:35:30,110 --> 00:35:30,960
Why so mad?

842
00:35:31,630 --> 00:35:32,030
You allowed

843
00:35:32,030 --> 00:35:33,400
me to take photos of you, didn't you?

844
00:35:33,400 --> 00:35:35,660
How was I supposed to know
you meant to...

845
00:35:40,480 --> 00:35:41,840
Did you really think

846
00:35:42,110 --> 00:35:43,510
I wanted to keep photos or you?

847
00:35:43,510 --> 00:35:44,710
How's that possible?

848
00:35:53,480 --> 00:35:54,340
Class monitor.

849
00:35:57,840 --> 00:35:59,670
The fee for the Math Olympiad
training class.

850
00:35:59,670 --> 00:36:00,440
Count it.

851
00:36:02,550 --> 00:36:04,410
You went through all this trouble

852
00:36:04,670 --> 00:36:05,800
just to earn the fee?

853
00:36:05,920 --> 00:36:07,720
What else reason could there be?

854
00:36:09,760 --> 00:36:11,150
I always keep my word.

855
00:36:11,840 --> 00:36:12,770
My study secrets

856
00:36:13,190 --> 00:36:15,650
and all the key knowledge points
are in here.

857
00:36:25,710 --> 00:36:27,370
It covers everything, right?

858
00:36:29,000 --> 00:36:30,930
I stayed up all night writing this.

859
00:36:31,150 --> 00:36:32,360
Look at my hand.

860
00:36:32,590 --> 00:36:34,270
It's practically disabled.

861
00:36:37,840 --> 00:36:38,670
Aren't you afraid of ranking

862
00:36:38,670 --> 00:36:39,840
below me in the next monthly exam?

863
00:36:39,840 --> 00:36:40,640
No, not at all.

864
00:36:41,360 --> 00:36:42,690
If you do outperform me,

865
00:36:43,320 --> 00:36:45,180
then buy me breakfast for a month.

866
00:36:45,880 --> 00:36:47,140
I have to buy breakfast

867
00:36:47,280 --> 00:36:48,960
