868
00:36:49,630 --> 00:36:51,010
You're quite the businesswoman.

869
00:36:51,010 --> 00:36:52,190
If you defeat me because you have read

870
00:36:52,190 --> 00:36:52,710
my study secrets,

871
00:36:52,710 --> 00:36:53,920
shouldn't you treat me to breakfast?

872
00:36:53,920 --> 00:36:55,800
Then if you win,
you'll have to buy me breakfast.

873
00:36:55,800 --> 00:36:56,360
No way.

874
00:36:56,410 --> 00:36:58,540
You didn't write me any study secrets.

875
00:36:58,720 --> 00:37:01,050
Have you ever heard of repaying kindness?

876
00:37:12,630 --> 00:37:13,360
Qi Shi!

877
00:37:14,550 --> 00:37:15,280
Time to eat!

878
00:37:16,030 --> 00:37:16,550
Coming.

879
00:37:21,840 --> 00:37:22,440
Zongzi?

880
00:37:23,110 --> 00:37:23,510
Come on.

881
00:37:23,510 --> 00:37:24,240
They're hot.

882
00:37:25,110 --> 00:37:26,670
Eat zongzi at the Dragon Boat Festival...

883
00:37:26,670 --> 00:37:27,880
After Zhi eats zongzi
at the Dragon Boat Festival,

884
00:37:27,880 --> 00:37:29,340
he'll dominate the track.

885
00:37:29,880 --> 00:37:31,320
After you eat zongzi
at the Dragon Boat Festival,

886
00:37:31,320 --> 00:37:32,920
you'll outsmart prodigies.

887
00:37:34,800 --> 00:37:36,130
This one has cured meat.

888
00:37:36,290 --> 00:37:37,480
L-Leave this for Zhi.

889
00:37:37,480 --> 00:37:38,610
T-That ingredient's bad for you.

890
00:37:38,610 --> 00:37:40,350
You should have one with red dates.

891
00:37:40,350 --> 00:37:42,280
This one. This green one
contains red dates.

892
00:37:42,280 --> 00:37:43,020
I want sugar then.

893
00:37:43,020 --> 00:37:43,680
No problem.

894
00:37:43,710 --> 00:37:44,440
Aunt Lingzhi spent

895
00:37:44,440 --> 00:37:46,300
the entire morning making these.

896
00:37:47,190 --> 00:37:47,920
You're back.

897
00:37:49,440 --> 00:37:50,150
It's so hot today.

898
00:37:50,150 --> 00:37:50,620
So hot...

899
00:37:50,620 --> 00:37:52,460
Look, so much sweat on your back.

900
00:37:53,590 --> 00:37:53,920
Here.

901
00:37:57,230 --> 00:37:58,150
Let me wipe your face.

902
00:37:58,150 --> 00:37:58,460
Okay.

903
00:37:58,460 --> 00:37:59,460
I can do it myself.

904
00:38:02,030 --> 00:38:03,320
Why is it so hot today?

905
00:38:03,340 --> 00:38:03,900
Honey.

906
00:38:06,510 --> 00:38:07,170
Count this.

907
00:38:07,590 --> 00:38:08,120
Go ahead.

908
00:38:11,590 --> 00:38:12,050
This...

909
00:38:14,480 --> 00:38:16,480
W-Why has your business been so good

910
00:38:16,510 --> 00:38:18,190
these past few months?

911
00:38:19,000 --> 00:38:19,590
Honey,

912
00:38:20,030 --> 00:38:21,030
I'm not bragging,

913
00:38:21,400 --> 00:38:22,760
but I am a bit talented

914
00:38:23,480 --> 00:38:24,360
in doing

915
00:38:24,360 --> 00:38:25,550
business.

916
00:38:27,140 --> 00:38:29,100
Cows eat grass. Bears eat meat.

917
00:38:29,760 --> 00:38:32,290
As long as we cater to
the customers' demands,

918
00:38:32,590 --> 00:38:34,360
there's no worry about raking in profit.

919
00:38:34,360 --> 00:38:35,070
Right, Sweetie?

920
00:38:35,070 --> 00:38:35,710
Exactly.

921
00:38:36,480 --> 00:38:37,110
With his experience

922
00:38:37,110 --> 00:38:38,510
as a street vendor for 10 years,

923
00:38:38,510 --> 00:38:39,650
my dad has finally summarized

924
00:38:39,650 --> 00:38:40,840
such a profound theory.

925
00:38:40,840 --> 00:38:42,440
What a real business prodigy.

926
00:38:42,440 --> 00:38:43,230
Well, it...

927
00:38:43,250 --> 00:38:44,780
Business prodigy, my foot.

928
00:38:45,070 --> 00:38:46,670
He was just in luck.

929
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:48,800
Listen,

930
00:38:49,000 --> 00:38:49,710
seriously,

931
00:38:50,720 --> 00:38:52,590
t-the building of the nearby market

932
00:38:52,590 --> 00:38:53,720
is almost finished.

933
00:38:53,890 --> 00:38:55,110
Let's go check it out
someday

934
00:38:55,110 --> 00:38:56,550
and pick a good spot.

935
00:38:56,710 --> 00:38:57,240
Alright?

936
00:38:57,360 --> 00:38:58,480
We should quickly

937
00:38:58,510 --> 00:38:59,370
secure a place.

938
00:38:59,880 --> 00:39:00,360
Okay.

939
00:39:00,400 --> 00:39:01,730
This one has cured meat.

940
00:39:01,840 --> 00:39:02,240
Got it.

941
00:39:03,870 --> 00:39:04,890
Now, our family

942
00:39:04,920 --> 00:39:06,760
finally has some property.

943
00:39:07,710 --> 00:39:09,280
I've come up with a name for our shop.

944
00:39:09,280 --> 00:39:11,280
It'll be "Qi's Grocery Store."

945
00:39:12,120 --> 00:39:12,550
What do you think?

946
00:39:12,550 --> 00:39:14,010
Sounds great, doesn't it?

947
00:39:14,070 --> 00:39:15,000
It seems like

948
00:39:15,000 --> 00:39:16,110
a century-old shop, right?

949
00:39:16,110 --> 00:39:16,640
Exactly.

950
00:39:16,760 --> 00:39:17,190
Right?

951
00:39:17,670 --> 00:39:19,070
A century-old shop?

952
00:39:19,550 --> 00:39:20,480
I'm telling you,

953
00:39:20,560 --> 00:39:21,760
our kids won't suffer

954
00:39:21,760 --> 00:39:22,800
like you do.

955
00:39:24,630 --> 00:39:25,670
But at least now

956
00:39:26,400 --> 00:39:27,840
we have a store, right?

957
00:39:28,600 --> 00:39:29,960
We won't have to be exposed

958
00:39:29,960 --> 00:39:31,490
to the sun and rain anymore.

959
00:39:33,190 --> 00:39:34,360
I have good news too.

960
00:39:36,190 --> 00:39:38,240
I won first prize

961
00:39:38,260 --> 00:39:39,840
in the national Math Olympiad finals.

962
00:39:39,840 --> 00:39:40,700
My teacher said

963
00:39:41,110 --> 00:39:42,440
this could add 15 points

964
00:39:43,000 --> 00:39:44,440
to my college entrance exam result.

965
00:39:44,440 --> 00:39:45,580
Fifteen points?

966
00:39:46,360 --> 00:39:47,190
My goodness.

967
00:39:48,230 --> 00:39:49,670
Our daughter's amazing.

968
00:39:50,070 --> 00:39:51,040
You've left

969
00:39:51,070 --> 00:39:52,670
all the others miles behind!

970
00:39:53,590 --> 00:39:54,800
See, I told you so.

971
00:39:55,190 --> 00:39:56,710
What's the point of a training class?

972
00:39:56,710 --> 00:39:57,380
You did great

973
00:39:57,380 --> 00:39:58,710
on your own, didn't you?

974
00:39:59,030 --> 00:39:59,500
Seriously.

975
00:39:59,500 --> 00:40:00,110
Come on!

976
00:40:00,710 --> 00:40:02,910
A chicken drumstick as a reward for you.

977
00:40:04,190 --> 00:40:04,650
Then...

978
00:40:04,960 --> 00:40:05,850
I want one too.

979
00:40:05,960 --> 00:40:07,190
You want one too?

980
00:40:08,840 --> 00:40:10,170
Here's a big one for you,

981
00:40:10,230 --> 00:40:12,290
since you brought back so much money.

982
00:40:17,960 --> 00:40:18,590
Honey,

983
00:40:19,920 --> 00:40:21,440
could you give me

984
00:40:21,840 --> 00:40:23,550
a little more allowance?

985
00:40:25,110 --> 00:40:26,320
Are you craving alcohol again?

986
00:40:26,320 --> 00:40:27,380
Where is that from?

987
00:40:28,890 --> 00:40:29,690
The allowance

988
00:40:29,710 --> 00:40:31,040
you give me every month

989
00:40:31,070 --> 00:40:32,670
adds up to less than 100 yuan.

990
00:40:32,920 --> 00:40:33,980
How is that enough?

991
00:40:34,800 --> 00:40:36,260
One hundred is not enough?

992
00:40:37,190 --> 00:40:38,790
You eat and drink at home

993
00:40:39,230 --> 00:40:41,230
with no worries about the social expenses.

994
00:40:41,230 --> 00:40:43,000
How are you not satisfied?

995
00:40:43,550 --> 00:40:44,360
Tell me

996
00:40:44,360 --> 00:40:45,920
w-where do you spend money.

997
00:40:46,360 --> 00:40:46,890
What for?

998
00:40:49,280 --> 00:40:49,940
Never mind.

999
00:40:50,310 --> 00:40:50,760
I know

1000
00:40:50,760 --> 00:40:52,360
you must be craving alcohol.

1001
00:40:52,550 --> 00:40:53,550
Just drop the act!

1002
00:40:53,630 --> 00:40:54,230
It's Zhi?

1003
00:40:56,630 --> 00:40:57,440
Son,

1004
00:40:57,920 --> 00:40:59,650
how have you been lately? Good?

1005
00:40:59,800 --> 00:41:02,200
Your dad, your sister and I are
doing great.

1006
00:41:02,440 --> 00:41:04,370
Your sister got wonderful grades.

1007
00:41:05,230 --> 00:41:06,090
Let me tell you,

1008
00:41:06,330 --> 00:41:07,460
your dad's business

1009
00:41:07,480 --> 00:41:09,010
has been picking up lately.

1010
00:41:09,030 --> 00:41:11,280
I'll give you 200 yuan for allowance.

1011
00:41:11,630 --> 00:41:12,590
I'm doing great too.

1012
00:41:12,590 --> 00:41:13,320
Thanks, Mom.

1013
00:41:13,320 --> 00:41:14,840
Mom, I've got news for you too.

1014
00:41:14,840 --> 00:41:15,510
I broke

1015
00:41:15,510 --> 00:41:16,550
my personal best record

1016
00:41:16,550 --> 00:41:17,710
again this month.

1017
00:41:18,000 --> 00:41:18,710
My coach has recommended me

1018
00:41:18,710 --> 00:41:20,040
to the provincial team.

1019
00:41:21,230 --> 00:41:22,710
That's great, Son.

1020
00:41:23,070 --> 00:41:24,270
Keep up the good work.

1021
00:41:24,760 --> 00:41:25,320
Win a few

1022
00:41:25,630 --> 00:41:26,700
more awards.

1023
00:41:27,110 --> 00:41:27,960
After you make the provincial team,

1024
00:41:27,960 --> 00:41:29,230
bring a national championship

1025
00:41:29,230 --> 00:41:30,280
home.

1026
00:41:30,970 --> 00:41:31,670
The Qi family

1027
00:41:31,670 --> 00:41:33,440
is counting on you to bring honor back!

1028
00:41:33,440 --> 00:41:34,500
That's right, Zhi.

1029
00:41:34,590 --> 00:41:35,440
Here, we'd like to

1030
00:41:35,440 --> 00:41:36,590
toast to you in advance,

1031
00:41:36,590 --> 00:41:38,400
our future

1032
00:41:38,510 --> 00:41:39,640
national champion.

1033
00:41:40,070 --> 00:41:40,800
Sure,

1034
00:41:41,670 --> 00:41:43,670
second prize winner of the Math Olympiad.

1035
00:41:43,670 --> 00:41:44,630
Well done, Xin.

1036
00:41:44,840 --> 00:41:45,900
You did a great job.

1037
00:41:48,030 --> 00:41:48,960
But don't get cocky.

1038
00:41:48,960 --> 00:41:50,150
The college entrance exam is coming up.

1039
00:41:50,150 --> 00:41:50,920
You must devote yourself

1040
00:41:50,920 --> 00:41:52,800
to reviewing knowledge during these days.

1041
00:41:52,800 --> 00:41:53,710
Aim for Tsinghua and Peking University.

1042
00:41:53,710 --> 00:41:54,340
Here you are,

1043
00:41:54,340 --> 00:41:54,870
Grandpa.

1044
00:41:55,070 --> 00:41:55,480
Okay.

1045
00:41:59,960 --> 00:42:00,280
Dad,

1046
00:42:01,000 --> 00:42:03,200
I'd like to discuss something with you.

1047
00:42:04,630 --> 00:42:05,890
When it's time to apply

1048
00:42:06,080 --> 00:42:07,000
for a major, I want to choose

1049
00:42:07,000 --> 00:42:08,460
mechanical engineering.

1050
00:42:09,080 --> 00:42:10,400
I heard a lot of people have picked

1051
00:42:10,400 --> 00:42:11,460
this major lately.

1052
00:42:11,550 --> 00:42:13,710
This way, finding a job after graduation
will be easier.

1053
00:42:13,710 --> 00:42:14,510
Sounds great.

1054
00:42:24,360 --> 00:42:25,960
Xin has always enjoyed fiddling

1055
00:42:25,960 --> 00:42:27,820
with gadgets since he was little.

1056
00:42:28,150 --> 00:42:29,320
I remember when he was

1057
00:42:29,320 --> 00:42:30,590
about seven or eight,

1058
00:42:31,510 --> 00:42:32,230
he once

1059
00:42:32,400 --> 00:42:34,510
took my transistor radio apart.

1060
00:42:35,440 --> 00:42:36,320
Oh my goodness.

1061
00:42:36,760 --> 00:42:38,710
It was the precious radio
that I couldn't live without!

1062
00:42:38,710 --> 00:42:39,800
He scattered the parts all over the table.

1063
00:42:39,800 --> 00:42:40,780
I got so mad.

1064
00:42:41,920 --> 00:42:43,320
But in the blink of an eye,

1065
00:42:43,400 --> 00:42:44,730
he put it back together.

1066
00:42:45,510 --> 00:42:46,640
It happened, right?

1067
00:42:47,840 --> 00:42:48,230
Yeah.

1068
00:42:48,450 --> 00:42:49,810
He has also made me

1069
00:42:49,840 --> 00:42:51,110
an electric massager.

1070
00:42:51,130 --> 00:42:52,020
It works really well.

1071
00:42:52,020 --> 00:42:53,320
Several colleagues of mine asked

1072
00:42:53,320 --> 00:42:54,320
where I bought it.

1073
00:42:55,320 --> 00:42:55,670
Xin,

1074
00:42:56,110 --> 00:42:56,640
go for it.

1075
00:42:56,960 --> 00:42:58,760
I think that engineering thingy

1076
00:42:59,010 --> 00:43:00,360
you mentioned is a suitable major

1077
00:43:00,360 --> 00:43:00,880
for you.
